				"string" : "{{gtClass:name=LcsTableDefinition}} \n- {{gtMethod:name=LcsTableDefinition>>caption}}  - optional\n\t- a caption/title for the table\t\n\t- location is a presentation issue - use 'caption-side: top or bottom' in the css to define location.\n\t- top is the default\n- LcsTableDefinition>>#parent - The domain collection that the table is design to present.\n\t- The parent must be a subclass of {{gtClass:name=LcsBaseDomainCollection}}\n\t\t- table items source: \n\t\t\tsource collections:\n\t\t\t\t- #collection - Default - all objects contained in the domain collection's **collection** method.\n\t\t\t\t- #actualCollection - collection with changes current transaction additions and deletions.\n\t\t\tfilter - filters can be applied to the collections\n\t\t\t\t- #tableCollection - source collection with the filter applied \n\n\t\t- {{gtMethod:name=LcsDomainCollection>>collection}}\n\t\t- this is the items in the collection at the beginning of the transaction.\nwith data which is to be displayed by the table. By default this will return the domain collection's collection. This collection is the contents at the beginning of the unit of work. Use \n"
